# Decisions

*Updated: 2026-06-10 09:00*

> **Sample seed** — Iantha reads this file for the first-run `/morning` demo while your real `decisions.md` is still blank. Sample content is never copied into live memory; say **"delete the samples"** to remove the `*.md.example` files once you're running on your own data.

Decisions the user has made. New entries go at the top (most recent first). Each entry needs a date and a `**Why**:` line — without the why, edge cases can't be judged later.

## Entry template

```
## YYYY-MM-DD: [short title]
**Decision**: [what was decided]
**Why**: [reasoning — constraints, tradeoffs, motivation]
**Notes**: [optional context]
```

---

## 2026-06-05: No conference talks this cycle
**Decision**: Skip the fall CFP round entirely.
**Why**: Prep historically costs ~30 hours per talk. Between the migration cutover and sweeper v0.2, that time doesn't exist this quarter.
**Notes**: Revisit for the spring round — the abstract draft is saved, not deleted.

## 2026-06-01: Team standup moves from daily to weekly
**Decision**: Switch the team standup from daily to weekly (Mondays).
**Why**: Signal-to-noise was too low — four out of five dailies had nothing that needed a meeting.
**Notes**: Revisit if the project enters a crunch phase. Recurring invite still needs updating (see tasks.md).

## 2026-05-24: Personal site moves off the VPS
**Decision**: Retire the self-hosted VPS; the personal site goes to a static host.
**Why**: The VPS was a pet — patching and babysitting it cost more evenings than the hosting bill justified, and the site is static anyway.
**Notes**: Domain stays; renewal is manual now (see tasks.md — auto-renew is off).
